Written `MIGRATION.md` in the workdir. It covers all six breaking changes from the v2 spec — `/v2/` prefix, Bearer auth (401 on old header), integer→UUID ids, `done`→`completed`, required `project_id` (422), and the paginated list envelope — each with before/after fenced examples, then a 10-step checklist and the upgrade command.

Two judgment calls worth knowing:
- The specs define no base URL, so curl examples use the placeholder `api.example.com`; swap in your real host.
- Neither spec documents an upgrade command; the guide ends with `pip install --upgrade zrb` (plus pipx/install-script variants), grounded in the zrb project's actual install method.
